## 12. Test / hook matrix

| ID | Assert |
| -- | ------ |
| MEM-LOGIN-MODAL-01 | Modal markers + presentation attr |
| MEM-LOGIN-MODAL-02 | `/login` auto-opens; session → redirect UX-02 |
| MEM-LOGIN-MODAL-03 | Register `?auth=login` opens modal; intake not in modal |
| MKT-PCMS-03 | Unchanged — SSR header from cookie |
| SMK-PTL-10 | Modal OTP → cookie probe → expected host behavior |
| PCMS-UX-MODAL-COOKIE | Success path always probes before complete |

## 13. Explicit non-goals (repeat)

- Tour intake/submit inside modal
- Marketing-owned OTP or cookie write
- Iframe login on marketing
- Changing operator session

## 14. Open follow-ups (non-blocking)

- Whether portal home `/` should also host `?auth=login` (optional)
- Exact desktop breakpoint token (reuse existing Denali media query)
- Backdrop click dismiss vs commit-only close

